# --- Large binary dependencies ----------------------------------------------
# Fetched by `scripts/download-dependencies.sh` (one command, checksum-verified).
# NOT committed because:
#   - Whisper base decoder is 130 MB (> GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit).
#   - Keeping the repo small means fast clones + cheap CI.
# A fresh clone needs to run the script once before `./gradlew :app:assembleDebug`.
# See README.md → "One-time setup".
android/app/src/main/assets/sherpa-whisper-base/
android/local-repo/

